<p>The Datum Dahleez model car includes details from the vehicle created by Datum Dahleez for the Gran Turismo video game in 2015. This includes a horseshoe front grille, rear wing, distinctive 8-eye headlights, a roof fin and wide tyres imprinted with ‘Michelin’. The toy car also includes a LEGO driver minifigure wearing a Datum Dahleez outfit to place inside the cockpit to enjoy races.</p>
